{title: Shenandoah}
{artist: Traditional}
{key: D}

{comment: Verse 1}
[D]Oh Shenandoah, I [G]long to see you,
[D]Away, you [Bm]rolling [A]river;
[D]Oh Shenandoah, I [G]long to see you,
A[D/F#]way, I'm [Em]bound a[D]way,
'Cross the [G]wide Mis[A7]sou[D]ri.

{comment: Verse 2}
[D]'Tis seven years since [G]last I saw you,
[D]Away, you [Bm]rolling [A]river;
[D]'Tis seven years since [G]last I saw you,
A[D/F#]way, I'm [Em]bound a[D]way,
'Cross the [G]wide Mis[A7]sou[D]ri.
